            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery kinking with poststenotic ectasia: multislice computed tomography completes diagnosis: a review of the literature.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>276-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/RCT.0b013e318074fde4</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>By describing the way of diagnosis, we report a case of coronary artery kinking associated with poststenotic dilatation. We give a review of the literature considering the different coronary morphology variations, etiological differential diagnosis, and the preferable terminology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
